  "description": "<p data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"452\">Ga op avontuur in de <strong data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"190\">Galar-regio</strong> met <strong data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"213\">Pokémon Shield</strong>, één van de populairste titels uit de Pokémon-serie. Vang nieuwe Pokémon, daag gyms uit, ontdek Dynamax-vormen en beleef een groots RPG-avontuur vol verkennen, battlen en verzamelen. Perfect voor zowel nieuwe spelers als ervaren trainers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"622\">Dit exemplaar is volledig getest, <strong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"508\">100% functioneel</strong> en verkeert <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"539\">In Nette Staat</strong>.<br data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"543\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"641\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"944\">\r\n<li data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"684\">\r\n<p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"684\">🐾 Verken de prachtige <strong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"682\">Galar-regio</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"732\">⚔️ Neem het op tegen uitdagende gym leaders</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"796\">\r\n<p data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"796\">🔥 Dynamax & Gigantamax vormen voor spectaculaire gevechten</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"841\">\r\n<p data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"841\">📦 Nieuwe Pokémon en regionale varianten</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"884\">\r\n<p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"884\">👫 Online & lokale multiplayer battles</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"944\">\r\n<p data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"944\">🎮 Uitstekende instap-Pokémon game voor alle leeftijden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"968\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1199\">\r\n<li data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"998\">\r\n<p data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"998\"><strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"981\">Titel:</strong> Pokémon Shield</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1032\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1032\"><strong data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1014\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1062\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1062\"><strong data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1045\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1092\"><strong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1075\">Genre:</strong> RPG / Avontuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1139\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1139\"><strong data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1107\">Spelers:</strong> 1 • Multiplayer online/lokaal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1199\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1199\"><strong data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1162\">Compatibiliteit:</strong> Switch • Switch OLED • Switch Lite</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1234\"><strong data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1224\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
